{"id":"wb-7-1494","name":"纳达齐牛录关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"纳达齐牛录关帝庙","text":"纳达齐牛录关帝庙（锡伯语：ᠨᠠᡩ᠋ᠠᠴᡳᠨᡳ᠍ᡵᡠᡳᡤᡠᠸᠠᠨᡩᡳᡝᠨᡩᡠᡵᡳᠮᡠᡣ᠋ᡨᡝ᠋ᡥᡝᠨ，罗马化：nadaci nirui guwan di enduri muktehen）是位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州察布查尔锡伯自治县纳达齐牛录乡纳达齐牛录村的关帝庙，是察布查尔县现存规模最大且保存较为完整的清代关帝庙。2013年，纳达齐牛录关帝庙被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BA%B3%E8%BE%BE%E9%BD%90%E7%89%9B%E5%BD%95%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94782021,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94782021","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/73de004038065937b6413ad6.jpg","title":"纳达齐牛录关帝庙背面.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%B3%E8%BE%BE%E9%BD%90%E7%89%9B%E5%BD%95%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/%E7%BA%B3%E8%BE%BE%E9%BD%90%E7%89%9B%E5%BD%95%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​纳达齐牛录关帝庙背面","width":320,"height":240}}